sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    Note over A: 1. Random bits +<br/>random bases (+/x)
    A->>B: 2. Send encoded qubits<br/>(quantum channel)
    Note over B: 3. Random measurement<br/>bases + measure
    A->>B: 4. Announce bases used
    B->>A: 4. Announce bases used
    Note over A,B: 5. Sifting: keep only<br/>matching-basis bits
    A->>B: 6. Reveal sample bits
    Note over A,B: 7. Estimate QBER,<br/>error correction,<br/>privacy amplification
    Note over A,B: Final secret key
